tive","type":"alternative","evidence":["lizang-q-4dd32d6de5ba21052d86","lizang-q-97b4d48b792349c78402","wuzhu-e-o073a-q"]}],"order":8271},{"id":"lizang-e2-wenpin-weilue-alternative","title":"《魏略》记文聘卧舍示疑，孙权不敢攻而去","accounts":[{"id":"lizang-a-68f2f9ffe8e707862191","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"《魏略》：孙权尝自将数万众猝至，时大雨城栅崩坏，人民散在田野未及补治","evidence":["lizang-q-4dd32d6de5ba21052d86"]},{"id":"lizang-a-ba7d90b153eacaa20774","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"《魏略》：聘敕城中人不得见，自卧舍中不起以疑敌，权疑有密图或外救，不敢攻而去","evidence":["lizang-q-97b4d48b792349c78402"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0250","role":"《魏略》所记卧舍示疑者","evidence":["lizang-q-4dd32d6de5ba21052d86","lizang-q-97b4d48b792349c78402"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"《魏略》所记疑有密谋而引众去者","evidence":["lizang-q-4dd32d6de5ba21052d86","lizang-q-97b4d48b792349c78402"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本篇独立行动，未继承范围不同的旧事件日期。","evidence":["lizang-q-4dd32d6de5ba21052d86","lizang-q-97b4d48b792349c78402"]},"ordering_evidence":"lizang-q-4dd32d6de5ba21052d86","related_events":[{"event":"wuzhu-e-o073a","type":"related","evidence":["lizang-q-4dd32d6de5ba21052d86","lizang-q-97b4d48b792349c78402","wuzhu-e-o073a-q"]},{"event":"wuzhu-e-o073a","type":"alternative","evidence":["lizang-q-4dd32d6de5ba21052d86","lizang-q-97b4d48b792349c78402","wuzhu-e-o073a-q"]},{"event":"lizang-e2-wenpin-alternative-comment","type":"related","evidence":["lizang-q2-7c7c7dd5620b6750e782","lizang-q-4dd32d6de5ba21052d86","lizang-q-97b4d48b792349c78402"]}],"order":3660}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0046","name":"朱然","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0170","name":"曹丕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0250","name":"文聘","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0055","name":"潘璋","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-q-o014","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-87bc74c5c9a764cda8ec","layer":"original","quote":"初，太后弟秉，以功封都乡侯。黄初七年，进封开阳侯，邑千二百户，为昭烈将军〖15〗。﹝二﹞秉薨，子兰嗣。少有才学，﹝三﹞为奉车都尉，游击将军〖16〗，加散骑常侍。兰薨，子晖嗣。﹝四﹞又分秉爵，封兰弟琳为列侯，官至步兵校尉。","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-38fa8be277bcfd39cf2f","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-3616192fc3097de9e23c","layer":"original","quote":"权住二十余日，乃解去。聘追击破之","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":88,"end":104,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-4dd32d6de5ba21052d86","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-c8eb075b65caf93a904c","layer":"pei","quote":"孙权尝自将数万众，猝至。时大雨，城栅崩坏；人民散在田野，未及补治","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c9dbffd502308ebdc57","start":10,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-6722d7bd71fd1780d081","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-3616192fc3097de9e23c","layer":"original","quote":"孙权以五万众，自围聘于石阳〖11〗，甚急；聘坚守不动","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":61,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-97b4d48b792349c78402","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-c8eb075b65caf93a904c","layer":"pei","quote":"聘闻权到，不知所施，乃思惟：莫若潜默可以疑之。乃敕城中人使不得见，又自卧舍中不起。权果疑之，语其部党曰：‘北方以此人忠臣也，故委之以此郡；今我至而不动，此不有密图，必当有外救。’遂不敢攻而去","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":108,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c9dbffd502308ebdc57","start":43,"end":138,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗七年：黄初七年（公元226）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-7290e2008f81d6cad349","start":0,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o001","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fe69417d79b76e276a24","layer":"original","quote":"明皇帝讳叡，字元仲。文帝太子也。生而太祖爱之，常令在左右。﹝一﹞年十五，封武德侯。黄初二年为齐公。三年为平原王〖1〗。以其母诛，故未建为嗣。﹝二﹞七年夏五月〖2〗，帝病笃，乃立为皇太子。丁巳〖3〗，即皇帝位。大赦；尊皇太后曰太皇太后〖4〗，皇后曰皇太后〖5〗；诸臣封爵各有差。﹝三﹞〔六月〕，癸未〖6〗，追谥母甄夫人曰文昭皇后〖7〗。壬辰〖8〗，立皇弟蕤为阳平王〖9〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o073a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-0d0ca9beff64e670c6fe","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，权闻魏文帝崩，征江夏，围石阳〖7〗；不克而还。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":388,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o072","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-212b92ae0749288b18b4","layer":"original","quote":"五年春〖1〗，令曰：“军兴日久，民离农畔〖2〗；父子夫妇，不听相恤〖3〗：孤甚愍之！今北虏缩窜，方外无事；其下州郡〖4〗，有以宽息。”是时，陆逊以所在少谷，表令诸将增广农亩。权报曰：“甚善！今孤父子亲自受田，车中八牛，以为四耦〖5〗；虽未及古人〖6〗，亦欲与众均等其劳也。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":387,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":137,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-14e1b46f84be6c83c9d1","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-4edd1e3fc33cd1ad20d5","layer":"original","quote":"夜出错乱，敌追击璋，璋不能禁。然即还住，拒敌，使前船得引极远，徐乃后发","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-f48e3fbcd27692e7fbff","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-4edd1e3fc33cd1ad20d5","layer":"original","quote":"（六）〔五〕年〖8〗，权自率众攻石阳；及至旋师，潘璋断后","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-6e9282e13715562cc246","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-5bf4e7d96e33d95524a0","layer":"original","quote":"黄武五年，权攻石阳","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":69,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
